 lookandfeel/components/GreeterFader.qml    |  67 ++++++++++++++
 lookandfeel/components/WallpaperFader.frag |  22 -----
 lookandfeel/components/WallpaperFader.qml  | 100 +++------------------
 4 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 113 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 lookandfeel/components/GreeterFader.qml
 delete mode 100644 lookandfeel/components/WallpaperFader.frag

